", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 328], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "d9a48266924d879bc1d0a35fd869e6ff5cf70a130d4cdea8164e27c4210a2efc", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 10], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "8c156bdfa7b1efc9ff1d2dad7dfda84096af94e4f8dbb138ddbf12add90c4d63", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/错题知识网络/可视化错题详情/高等数学/GS-607\\_138782.md 这道题我没有想到用乘积的方法。\n\n我是将它乘积之后，分母是 (n+1)n^(1/10)，分子是 n-1。我没有像题目上拆成两个敛散性，我认为它跟 1/n^(1/10) 是同敛散的。\n\n把它乘在一起之后，(n-1)/((n+1)n^(1/10)) 的通项大于 0，极限趋向于 0，并且是单调递减的，所以我直接判定它是条件收敛。\n\n我的判定方法好像不太对，对吧？"}